# Python
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Personal-use-only local character packs — never committed/pushed. Same
# reasoning as this project's earlier iteration: some assets (e.g. official
# Anthropic trademarked art) are fine for private on-device use but not for
# public redistribution in this repo. tools/prep_character.py writes to
# characters/<name>/, so anything named *-personal is excluded here.
characters/*-personal/

